CeruleanCity_House3_Text_PleaseTradeWithMyHusband::
    .string "My husband likes trading POKéMON.\p"
    .string "You're collecting POKéMON for your\n"
    .string "POKéDEX, aren't you?\p"
    .string "Would you please trade with him?$"


CeruleanCity_House3_Text_QuestAsk::
    .string "I'm a retired TRAINER.\pShow me a POKéMON at level 45\nor higher and I'll give you my\nLINK CABLE.$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_QuestOk::
    .string "That is a strong POKéMON!\nTake this LINK CABLE.$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_QuestGot::
    .string "{PLAYER} received a LINK CABLE!$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_QuestNo::
    .string "None of your POKéMON are strong\nenough yet. Train them!$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_QuestNoRoom::
    .string "Your BAG is full. Make some\nroom first!$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_QuestDone::
    .string "Does the LINK CABLE work well?$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_OldWomanAsk::
    .string "My husband is thirsty from all that\n"
    .string "trading. Our well went dry.\pTwo bottles of FRESH WATER would\n"
    .string "save his day, dear.$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_OldWomanOffer::
    .string "Is that FRESH WATER? Could you\n"
    .string "spare two for my husband?$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_OldWomanGives::
    .string "Oh, bless you! He drinks like a\n"
    .string "fish now.\pTake this, it was a gift to him\n"
    .string "from a trainer long ago.$"

CeruleanCity_House3_Text_OldWomanNo::
    .string "Of course, of course. He will\n"
    .string "manage.$"
